{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949700/extras/9837bd8e60ae39f5fdeb5676ea876c2f.poster.avif?t=1766620896\" width=780 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949700/extras/9837bd8e60ae39f5fdeb5676ea876c2f.webm?t=1766620896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949700/extras/9837bd8e60ae39f5fdeb5676ea876c2f.mp4?t=1766620896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZOMBIE TYPING</strong> is a tense typing survival game where your keyboard skills power every action. From moving and looting to reloading and blasting the undead away before they can eat your brains...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no buttons to mash or joysticks to flick: just you, the undead, and your ability to type under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949700/extras/85f1afc2b819b7cb8b12fdaffc6545e2.poster.avif?t=1766620896\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949700/extras/85f1afc2b819b7cb8b12fdaffc6545e2.webm?t=1766620896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949700/extras/85f1afc2b819b7cb8b12fdaffc6545e2.mp4?t=1766620896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mistakes can kill. Can you type fast <i>and</i> accurately enough to survive the outbreak and get home to your family?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949700?t=1766620896","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.